My mind is a very messy place.  You would not like what you might there within discover.  It would probably kill you to know my secrets.  What am I?  I am a teenage boy suffering from existential angst.  If I could communicate those feelings to you in a fluid manner you would not enjoy my constant pining.  You would find yourself filled with noise from conflicting beliefs.  You would find that all knowledge torn to bits, thrown in a room, is not but random utterances.  In J.R. Tokens Lord of the Rings, there is a group of beings called the Ents.  Do you remember these?  Surely you must realise that the effort of language is the thing that keeps us from becoming random.  All the mind is, is a bunch of thoughts.  It is in the light of consciousness that we chose what to say.  We need the barrier of language WE NEED IT!  


